1
00:01:48,080 --> 00:01:52,370
[A Good Day to Ascend]

2
00:01:55,160 --> 00:01:58,039
[Episode 2: The Deity Slayer, Xu Ying]

3
00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:12,520
It looks like this kid can't continue
with this game anymore.

4
00:02:16,610 --> 00:02:18,870
You've overestimated your own ability.

5
00:02:20,460 --> 00:02:23,020
You don't seem as strong as I've imagined.

6
00:02:23,420 --> 00:02:24,820
You had fun beating me up.

7
00:02:25,260 --> 00:02:26,100
Now,

8
00:02:27,020 --> 00:02:28,500
it's my turn.

9
00:02:30,420 --> 00:02:32,659
You've practiced
cultivation techniques before?

10
00:02:32,660 --> 00:02:34,220
You're kind of capable.

11
00:02:38,100 --> 00:02:39,499
Since you're merely a mortal,

12
00:02:39,500 --> 00:02:41,419
practicing cultivation techniques
is still useless.

13
00:02:41,420 --> 00:02:44,100
How dare you compete with me in strength?

14
00:02:45,220 --> 00:02:46,750
A strength technique, huh?

15
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:50,760
Shall I circulate the qi and blood
along this path?

16
00:02:56,140 --> 00:02:57,780
Elephant Force Bull Fist!

17
00:03:01,380 --> 00:03:03,819
The First Stance
of the Elephant Force Bull Fist—

18
00:03:03,820 --> 00:03:05,180
Star-Piercing Strike!

19
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:09,350
The

20
00:03:09,610 --> 00:03:10,220
second...

21
00:03:10,900 --> 00:03:11,830
The third level!

22
00:03:12,540 --> 00:03:13,540
The fourth level!

23
00:03:15,550 --> 00:03:16,459
This strength...

24
00:03:16,460 --> 00:03:17,660
How is this possible?

25
00:03:24,860 --> 00:03:27,699
How dare you hurt my body?

26
00:03:27,700 --> 00:03:30,690
I'll make sure
you'll die without a burial place!

27
00:03:53,630 --> 00:03:55,999
The Second Stance
of the Elephant Force Bull Fist—

28
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:57,389
Double Happiness!

29
00:03:57,390 --> 00:03:59,659
The Third Stance
of the Elephant Force Bull Fist—

30
00:03:59,660 --> 00:04:01,300
Lucky Strike!

31
00:04:02,740 --> 00:04:03,379
Wait!

32
00:04:03,380 --> 00:04:06,040
I'm willing to
bring rain for the whole village!

33
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:12,029
I'm sorry.

34
00:04:12,030 --> 00:04:14,950
I'll guarantee an abundant harvest
for the village!

35
00:04:14,390 --> 00:04:19,430
♪ There are all kinds of ways ♪

36
00:04:19,810 --> 00:04:25,020
♪ Saving people from impermanence ♪

37
00:04:22,140 --> 00:04:23,020
How foolish!

38
00:04:23,460 --> 00:04:26,420
How could I possibly
beg a nonentity for mercy?

39
00:04:25,910 --> 00:04:30,900
♪ A mournful howl resounds ♪

40
00:04:27,020 --> 00:04:29,080
It's time for your death, nonentity!

41
00:04:31,050 --> 00:04:35,330
♪ Piercing the chest ♪

42
00:04:36,530 --> 00:04:40,109
♪ Asking Heaven ♪

43
00:04:40,110 --> 00:04:44,700
♪ What crimes
did the common people commit? ♪

44
00:04:43,420 --> 00:04:44,769
You shouldn't have lied to me!

45
00:04:44,770 --> 00:04:47,520
♪ Why should they be killed? ♪

46
00:04:46,620 --> 00:04:47,500
This punch...

47
00:04:48,190 --> 00:04:51,340
♪ Why? ♪

48
00:04:48,380 --> 00:04:50,259
is to punish you
for forcing Uncle Jiang to his death!

49
00:04:50,260 --> 00:04:51,179
This punch

50
00:04:51,180 --> 00:04:52,900
is to punish you
for bullying Ms. Jiang Shu!

51
00:04:51,640 --> 00:04:56,409
♪ The virtue of cherishing lives
is all in vain ♪

52
00:04:53,380 --> 00:04:54,179
This punch

53
00:04:54,180 --> 00:04:55,859
is to punish you
for not fulfilling your duty as a deity!

54
00:04:55,860 --> 00:04:56,940
Please spare my life!

55
00:04:56,640 --> 00:04:58,869
♪ Watching without doing anything ♪

56
00:04:58,870 --> 00:05:02,520
♪ How ridiculous ♪

57
00:04:59,260 --> 00:05:00,219
As for this punch,

58
00:05:00,220 --> 00:05:02,150
it's just because I want to hit you!

59
00:05:02,610 --> 00:05:07,700
♪ Who should we ask about karma? ♪

60
00:05:06,260 --> 00:05:08,620
I'm registered both in the Phantom Capital
and the Imperial Court.

61
00:05:07,730 --> 00:05:10,030
♪ Make conclusions ♪

62
00:05:08,780 --> 00:05:11,020
If you kill me,
you'll violate the law of...

63
00:05:10,060 --> 00:05:12,780
♪ Open your eyes and watch ♪

64
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:14,040
[Slaying the deity]

65
00:05:12,800 --> 00:05:21,690
♪ When have we ever seen the shore
of suffering in the mortal world? ♪

66
00:05:40,060 --> 00:05:42,190
I'm sorry, Ying! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

67
00:05:48,100 --> 00:05:50,430
Guys, you don't have to be afraid anymore.

68
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:52,000
I've killed the bad guy.

69
00:06:01,350 --> 00:06:02,430
Why?

70
00:06:04,410 --> 00:06:05,620
Monster!

71
00:06:06,940 --> 00:06:08,579
God, please bless us.

72
00:06:08,580 --> 00:06:10,700
What a sin, oh, what a sin.

73
00:06:11,110 --> 00:06:12,950
I was standing up for you guys!

74
00:06:13,580 --> 00:06:14,260
Don't look!

75
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:17,520
You shouldn't be afraid of me.

76
00:06:30,700 --> 00:06:31,830
I did nothing wrong.

77
00:06:32,870 --> 00:06:34,550
I killed a bad guy.

78
00:06:44,790 --> 00:06:48,630
[The Deity Slayer, Xu Ying]

79
00:06:49,870 --> 00:06:50,710
Thank you all

80
00:06:50,980 --> 00:06:52,899
for taking care of me over these years.

81
00:06:52,900 --> 00:06:54,540
I'm sorry for the trouble

82
00:06:55,159 --> 00:06:56,320
I've caused you.

83
00:07:02,820 --> 00:07:03,860
Ying!

84
00:07:08,140 --> 00:07:08,940
Ying!

85
00:07:09,860 --> 00:07:10,820
Thank you.

86
00:07:12,020 --> 00:07:13,580
You have to live on well.

87
00:07:14,640 --> 00:07:15,320
Take care.

88
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:29,050
Xu Ying

89
00:07:29,460 --> 00:07:30,309
reached the fifth level

90
00:07:30,310 --> 00:07:32,279
of the Elephant Force Bull Fist
in just a short time?

91
00:07:32,280 --> 00:07:35,409
I've practiced this fist technique
for decades, but...

92
00:07:35,870 --> 00:07:37,870
Well, I have to ask him to teach me.

93
00:07:43,730 --> 00:07:45,930
While Xu Ying was fleeing,

94
00:07:47,130 --> 00:07:48,570
his act of killing a deity

95
00:07:49,580 --> 00:07:51,690
caught the attention
of both the Lingling City God

96
00:07:50,740 --> 00:07:52,070
[Phantom Realm, God of Land]

97
00:07:51,720 --> 00:07:54,740
and the Zhou family, which was one

98
00:07:53,620 --> 00:07:55,260
[Zhou Yang, Magistrate of Lingling]

99
00:07:54,860 --> 00:07:57,500
of the Eight Great Nuo Shaman Families.

100
00:08:00,660 --> 00:08:01,499
Father,

101
00:08:01,500 --> 00:08:03,059
a case occurred in Jiang's Village.

102
00:08:03,060 --> 00:08:04,739
A snake hunter named Xu Ying

103
00:08:04,740 --> 00:08:06,059
killed both the councillor

104
00:08:06,060 --> 00:08:08,939
and the Phantom Deity
that was worshipped by Jiang's Village.

105
00:08:08,940 --> 00:08:10,019
He's currently on the run.

106
00:08:10,020 --> 00:08:12,020
Since he was able
to kill the Phantom Deity,

107
00:08:11,640 --> 00:08:14,240
[Zhou Yihang, Governor of Lingling]

108
00:08:12,020 --> 00:08:14,539
is this snake hunter a Nuo Shaman?

109
00:08:14,540 --> 00:08:16,669
This is what I'd like to tell you, Father.

110
00:08:16,670 --> 00:08:19,830
These were found in Xu Ying's house.

111
00:08:19,980 --> 00:08:22,739
The demon race's cultivation techniques
at the qi gathering stage.

112
00:08:22,740 --> 00:08:26,020
So Xu Ying practiced
the demon race's cultivation techniques?

113
00:08:23,550 --> 00:08:25,880
[Xue Lingfu, Lingling City God]

114
00:08:26,420 --> 00:08:28,859
My Lord,
look at the annotations at the back.

115
00:08:28,860 --> 00:08:31,940
Xu Ying's annotations
are absolute nonsense.

116
00:08:37,230 --> 00:08:38,319
What an idiot.

117
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:42,390
[Ximen Grimoire]

118
00:08:38,610 --> 00:08:40,869
This person's understanding
of demonic techniques

119
00:08:40,870 --> 00:08:42,940
is extremely profound now.

120
00:08:43,059 --> 00:08:47,539
Even the elders of my Zhou family
who study this might not surpass him.

121
00:08:47,540 --> 00:08:48,919
These demonic techniques

122
00:08:48,920 --> 00:08:52,740
are just some fragments
of mantras at the qi gathering stage.

123
00:08:52,940 --> 00:08:53,899
Why would...

124
00:08:53,900 --> 00:08:56,019
The matter
of the demon race's cultivation techniques

125
00:08:56,020 --> 00:08:57,499
has a wide and significant impact.

126
00:08:57,500 --> 00:08:58,740
Pass on my order.

127
00:08:59,400 --> 00:09:01,640
All Phantom Deities,

128
00:09:02,800 --> 00:09:03,840
officers

129
00:09:04,350 --> 00:09:05,619
and Nuo Shamans around Lingling

130
00:09:05,620 --> 00:09:08,940
should spare no effort to capture Xu Ying.
Don't kill him.

131
00:09:09,580 --> 00:09:11,100
I want him alive.

132
00:09:12,220 --> 00:09:13,540
Yes, sir!

133
00:09:14,140 --> 00:09:14,980
Also,

134
00:09:15,590 --> 00:09:19,110
if the Nuo Shamans of the Zhou family
find Xu Ying first,

135
00:09:19,880 --> 00:09:22,520
then just kill him without hesitation.

136
00:09:23,350 --> 00:09:24,830
We must make sure that

137
00:09:25,100 --> 00:09:26,420
even if Xu Ying

138
00:09:26,760 --> 00:09:28,780
is dead,

139
00:09:30,510 --> 00:09:35,570
- his body can't be taken by the Phantom Capital.
- his body can't be taken by the Zhou family.

140
00:09:36,090 --> 00:09:38,640
[The next day]

141
00:09:40,630 --> 00:09:42,220
Guys, guard every intersection.

142
00:09:40,740 --> 00:09:43,730
[Feng Yi, Phantom Deity
of Huangni Bridge Village]

143
00:09:42,700 --> 00:09:43,980
Don't slack off.

144
00:09:44,510 --> 00:09:45,870
That guy named Xu Ying

145
00:09:45,990 --> 00:09:48,320
will definitely pass through this place.

146
00:09:48,580 --> 00:09:49,980
We can't let him get away.

147
00:09:56,560 --> 00:09:57,320
Oh, no.

148
00:09:57,460 --> 00:09:59,120
There are people everywhere!

149
00:09:59,660 --> 00:10:00,860
Just see what I'll do.

150
00:10:06,980 --> 00:10:08,079
There is a snake demon!

151
00:10:08,080 --> 00:10:09,560
My Lady, save me!

152
00:10:12,100 --> 00:10:13,979
Where did this little demon come from?

153
00:10:13,980 --> 00:10:15,040
I'll just kill you!

154
00:10:18,270 --> 00:10:21,739
Her Ladyship is mighty!
Her Ladyship is mighty!

155
00:10:21,740 --> 00:10:23,499
With the coming storm on the mountain,

156
00:10:23,500 --> 00:10:24,180
the wind...

157
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:27,419
Only a fool would wait for your nagging.

158
00:10:27,420 --> 00:10:30,380
Her Ladyship got eaten!

159
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:35,230
[Again, the next day]

160
00:10:35,980 --> 00:10:37,470
[Five Herbs Man,
Phantom Deity of Tugang Village]

161
00:10:36,560 --> 00:10:38,340
Xu Ying, you bold thief!

162
00:10:38,540 --> 00:10:40,400
Under the order of the City God...

163
00:10:41,020 --> 00:10:41,860
Step aside!

164
00:10:47,160 --> 00:10:49,460
[Yuan Ling,
Phantom Deity of Zao's Village]

165
00:10:47,780 --> 00:10:50,140
You're just in time, Xu Ying!

166
00:10:51,180 --> 00:10:53,279
Kneel down!

167
00:10:53,280 --> 00:10:54,010
Get lost!

168
00:10:59,160 --> 00:11:00,930
[Huan Ledou, Phantom Deity of Gouzitou]

169
00:11:04,100 --> 00:11:06,080
[Nian Xiu, River God of Sanlidu]

170
00:11:05,820 --> 00:11:06,639
Yuanqi!

171
00:11:06,640 --> 00:11:07,560
Do it now!

172
00:11:16,580 --> 00:11:17,980
May you be prosperous!

173
00:11:18,550 --> 00:11:21,950
May you be prosperous!

174
00:11:19,400 --> 00:11:20,400
[Jiu Wangcai,
Phantom Deity of Bai's Village]

175
00:11:25,980 --> 00:11:29,060
May you be prosperous!

176
00:11:32,660 --> 00:11:35,060
Brat, stop right there!

177
00:11:36,880 --> 00:11:39,100
[Mang Hao,
Mountain God of Mount Hong]

178
00:11:49,700 --> 00:11:51,430
You can't catch up with me, huh?

179
00:11:53,300 --> 00:11:54,019
Run faster!

180
00:11:54,020 --> 00:11:55,059
This guy can't run fast.

181
00:11:55,060 --> 00:11:55,859
We can just make him run to death.

182
00:11:55,860 --> 00:11:56,659
Shut up!

183
00:11:56,660 --> 00:11:57,419
If you keep nagging,

184
00:11:57,420 --> 00:11:58,950
I'll throw you down as bait.

185
00:12:00,620 --> 00:12:02,660
Stop!

186
00:12:18,850 --> 00:12:21,970
Come out at once!

187
00:12:25,750 --> 00:12:28,099
The God of Mount Hong
is really a nuisance.

188
00:12:28,100 --> 00:12:29,700
Fortunately, he is too slow.

189
00:12:30,100 --> 00:12:32,430
Otherwise, we would really be in trouble.

190
00:12:33,800 --> 00:12:34,680
Well, Yuan...

191
00:12:35,590 --> 00:12:36,520
Just call me Niu.

192
00:12:37,140 --> 00:12:39,879
My ancestor
practiced the Elephant Force Bull Fist.

193
00:12:39,880 --> 00:12:41,539
Therefore, he took the surname Niu.

194
00:12:41,540 --> 00:12:43,019
When I was born, my father said

195
00:12:43,020 --> 00:12:45,589
our kind of venomous snake
was called Yuan in ancient times.

196
00:12:45,590 --> 00:12:46,899
I am the seventh child,

197
00:12:46,900 --> 00:12:49,300
so he named me Yuanqi.

198
00:12:50,910 --> 00:12:51,750
Niu.

199
00:12:52,100 --> 00:12:54,899
It refers to Bull
in the Elephant Force Bull Fist.

200
00:12:54,900 --> 00:12:57,349
But it doesn't mean turning yourself
into a bull demon through the cultivation.

201
00:12:57,350 --> 00:12:59,089
Rather, it means
when practicing this fist technique,

202
00:12:59,090 --> 00:13:01,350
you should be as fearless as a bull demon.

203
00:13:02,190 --> 00:13:03,320
This fist technique

204
00:13:03,610 --> 00:13:05,330
has nothing to do with bulls.

205
00:13:06,550 --> 00:13:07,910
So you mean

206
00:13:08,950 --> 00:13:12,630
my ancestor misunderstood
the Elephant Force Bull Fist?

207
00:13:15,790 --> 00:13:17,110
My name is correct.

208
00:13:18,380 --> 00:13:20,240
But my family's surname is wrong.

209
00:13:20,630 --> 00:13:21,430
How about

210
00:13:21,970 --> 00:13:23,370
you change your surname?

211
00:13:26,620 --> 00:13:27,649
My ancestor's surname was Niu.

212
00:13:27,650 --> 00:13:28,679
My father's surname was Niu.

213
00:13:28,680 --> 00:13:30,669
How could I forget my roots
and betray my ancestors?

214
00:13:30,670 --> 00:13:32,790
A true man never changes his name.

215
00:13:33,020 --> 00:13:34,460
My name is Yuanqi!

216
00:13:36,070 --> 00:13:38,330
Now you're not mentioning your surname.

217
00:13:39,140 --> 00:13:40,940
Why did you call my name just now?

218
00:13:41,580 --> 00:13:43,419
You said we could go to Mount Wuwang
to take refuge.

219
00:13:43,420 --> 00:13:44,300
Where is it?

220
00:13:45,020 --> 00:13:47,119
My Qinyan Cave is on Mount Wuwang.

221
00:13:47,120 --> 00:13:48,600
It's an ancient relic,

222
00:13:49,140 --> 00:13:51,270
which is actually a good place to hide.

223
00:13:51,560 --> 00:13:53,600
However, we need to walk 200 miles.

224
00:13:54,470 --> 00:13:55,790
200 miles?

225
00:13:56,730 --> 00:13:59,119
Including the Mountain God
who chased us just now,

226
00:13:59,120 --> 00:14:01,520
there have been 10 deities already, right?

227
00:14:02,140 --> 00:14:04,399
We left Jiang's Village
and headed for Mount Wuwang.

228
00:14:04,400 --> 00:14:06,249
We haven't even gone a few dozen miles,

229
00:14:06,250 --> 00:14:09,850
but we've encountered
so many Phantom Deities trying to stop us.

230
00:14:10,300 --> 00:14:13,430
It looks like the City God
has issued an order to kill you.

231
00:14:13,580 --> 00:14:15,089
In Lingling, with its 800 mountains

232
00:14:15,090 --> 00:14:16,290
and 500 rivers,

233
00:14:16,620 --> 00:14:18,740
plus its lakes and villages,

234
00:14:19,060 --> 00:14:21,699
there are at least over 2,000
Phantom Deities.

235
00:14:21,700 --> 00:14:25,560
We've been walking along
the most desolate paths as much as possible.

236
00:14:25,820 --> 00:14:28,219
These Phantom Deities
on the wild mountains

237
00:14:28,220 --> 00:14:30,099
were designated as deities
by the demon race.

238
00:14:30,100 --> 00:14:34,030
They're more powerful than the ones
worshipped in towns and villages.

239
00:14:40,780 --> 00:14:43,009
The City God's kill order
is targeted at me.

240
00:14:43,010 --> 00:14:44,889
If we really can't escape from here,

241
00:14:44,890 --> 00:14:46,620
you can just leave by yourself.

242
00:14:47,900 --> 00:14:49,660
I... I can leave by myself?

243
00:14:49,900 --> 00:14:50,760
What about you?

244
00:14:52,260 --> 00:14:54,459
A true man bears the consequences
of his own actions.

245
00:14:54,460 --> 00:14:55,990
I killed the Phantom Deity.

246
00:14:56,180 --> 00:14:57,220
I'll bear

247
00:14:57,340 --> 00:14:59,140
all the consequences by myself.

248
00:14:59,830 --> 00:15:02,690
It's good to say, "A true man
bears the consequences

249
00:15:03,080 --> 00:15:04,400
of his own actions."

250
00:15:05,920 --> 00:15:08,880
The cries of nonentities
are truly pleasant to hear.

251
00:15:09,380 --> 00:15:10,640
Government official?

252
00:15:10,790 --> 00:15:11,710
Oh, no.

253
00:15:11,900 --> 00:15:12,700
Xu Ying.

254
00:15:13,010 --> 00:15:15,199
Lingling City
is the Zhou family's territory.

255
00:15:15,200 --> 00:15:16,769
You killed Councillor Jiang

256
00:15:16,770 --> 00:15:18,720
and broke the Zhou family's rules.

257
00:15:23,170 --> 00:15:25,250
Just surrender and face your punishment.

258
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:25,640
[Ding Quan, Judicial Officer of Lingling]

259
00:15:27,980 --> 00:15:29,299
He colluded with the Phantom Deity

260
00:15:29,300 --> 00:15:32,160
and disregarded human lives,
so he deserved to die.

261
00:15:33,200 --> 00:15:34,680
Human lives?

262
00:15:34,990 --> 00:15:36,419
The lives of you nonentities

263
00:15:36,420 --> 00:15:39,420
are nothing
compared to Magistrate Zhou's prestige.

264
00:15:40,080 --> 00:15:41,280
My name's Ding Quan.

265
00:15:41,870 --> 00:15:43,870
I'm a judicial officer in Lingling.

266
00:15:46,420 --> 00:15:47,550
You're a Nuo Shaman?

267
00:15:47,980 --> 00:15:48,820
Yes.

268
00:15:49,270 --> 00:15:50,550
I am a Nuo Shaman.

269
00:15:51,100 --> 00:15:54,360
This is the orthodox cultivation method
of our human race.

270
00:15:54,940 --> 00:15:57,400
It's to discover the secrets
of human bodies

271
00:15:57,580 --> 00:16:00,380
and succeed in the method
of becoming an immortal.

272
00:16:00,670 --> 00:16:02,949
It's totally different
from the demonic techniques

273
00:16:02,950 --> 00:16:05,110
you've been practicing randomly.

274
00:16:06,230 --> 00:16:07,899
I've heard that Nuo techniques

275
00:16:07,900 --> 00:16:10,300
are only spread among some noble families.

276
00:16:10,950 --> 00:16:13,100
Your deceased parents were useless.

277
00:16:13,380 --> 00:16:15,839
Their son is also a loser.

278
00:16:15,840 --> 00:16:17,500
You deserve to be trampled on.

279
00:16:19,380 --> 00:16:20,759
My Nuo techniques

280
00:16:20,760 --> 00:16:23,859
come precisely
from the great Zhou family of Yongzhou.

281
00:16:23,860 --> 00:16:25,860
If you work as hard as I did,

282
00:16:26,100 --> 00:16:28,900
you can also
gain the Zhou family's appreciation.

283
00:16:29,900 --> 00:16:31,460
So you mean being a lackey

284
00:16:31,780 --> 00:16:33,020
for the Zhou family?

285
00:16:34,670 --> 00:16:36,930
And you actually feel superior about it?

286
00:16:37,320 --> 00:16:39,880
You don't even have the chance
to be a lackey!

287
00:17:05,960 --> 00:17:07,910
Today, you'll see

288
00:17:06,329 --> 00:17:10,390
[In the next episode]

289
00:17:07,910 --> 00:17:10,160
the orthodox Nuo arts you've never seen

290
00:17:10,550 --> 00:17:12,470
in your life.

291
00:17:12,849 --> 00:17:15,328
Congratulations, Lord Stone Mountain God.

292
00:17:15,329 --> 00:17:18,828
The credit for capturing Xu Ying
will surely be yours.

293
00:17:18,829 --> 00:17:19,740
Come on.

294
00:17:19,900 --> 00:17:21,480
Let's go take a look.

295
00:17:24,329 --> 00:17:26,459
There are so many ghosts
coming out of the realm.

296
00:17:26,460 --> 00:17:28,430
I'm afraid
the mortal world will be in trouble.

